Data Source                  : 3h ECMWF operational analysis wind and surface pressure
Horizontal domain            : global
Horizontal resolution        : 0.5 x 0.5 degree (regular grid) 
Correction                   : Atm. surface pressure tides are subtracted, inverted barometer correction over ocean applied
 
Data assimilated             : None

Notes : These AAMs are part of a set of consistently processed Earth rotation excitation 
        function (AAM, OAM, HAM). The ocean model MPIOM and the hydrological model LSDM were
        forced consistently with operational analysis data from the ECMWF.

